  "goodToKnow": "Die Klausur is a written exam at a university or in the upper years of school: eine Klausur schreiben, durch die Klausur fallen. It also means seclusion or retreat: Die Partei geht in Klausur, and eine Klausurtagung is a closed-door strategy meeting where parties often hammer out plans. In monasteries, die Klausur is the area closed to outsiders. From Latin clausura (closure). Plural: die Klausuren."
